      "message": "Could we understand why before removing those tests from the TEST_MAPPING ? \n\nBecause those tests are running as part of `test_mapping/presubmit-avd` configuration, for example here on a recent presubmit for one of my CLs \nhttps://android-build.corp.google.com/test_investigate/?invocationId\u003dI32300010191740392\u0026testResultId\u003dTR44128893699444639\n\nAnd for example, looking at the `Android.bp` file, I don\u0027t understand the difference between [`bluetooth_le_audio_client_test`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/Android.bp;l\u003d816;drc\u003d634365bbbbfe45b36cc66a3498db9d42d985c8c2) and [`bluetooth_hh_test`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/Android.bp;l\u003d1132;drc\u003d634365bbbbfe45b36cc66a3498db9d42d985c8c2) (Both part of `device-tests`, same defaults, same configuration)",
